    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41172" root="هزج" body-key="h">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هزّج الصَّوْتَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهْزِيجٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a singer
[or a reader or reciter]), <i>made the sounds of the
voice to be closely consecutive, and uttered in a
light and quick manner.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هزّج صَوْتَهُ</span>,
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهزّجهُ</span></b> , [the latter app. a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تهزّج</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهِ</span>,] <i>He made the sounds of his voice to be closely
consecutive,</i> or <i>near together.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See 1.

